    - target: {fileID: 9070986682265164292, guid: 5544226b037396441bbf3325159d66b0, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "\tIt's settled then. I agreeded to process all that meat for our colony.\n\r\n\tStEVEN
        taught me the next steps of the meat portions preparation. He also left me
        a note on the corkboard if I needed a reminder. Then said he'll have to leave
        soon to hunt some more of these creatures.\n\r\n\tWhile we were working,
        I couldn't help this feeling that the meat was moving under my fingers and...
        whispering. I started panicking. Good thing StEVEN was there with me to ensure
        me it was all in my head."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
